Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The pain\Nwithin brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you before you\Neven have a chance to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu, splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's join the Straw Hats\Nand take out the big guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't our place to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting the lead performers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We must keep both our enemies and\Nour allies away from the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're saying, "Don't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the red line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing up there is Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you to be\Nsuperstitious. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you drunk or something, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing worth\Nseeing up in Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of stuck-up\Ncelestial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're no gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about\Nthe world we know today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the way\Nthings were in the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before Marijua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They say there was a\Nland of gods up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost to the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever told you that was\Neither crazy or playing a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But this world is full of strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop daydreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a fight right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was waiting for you to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Izo, do you believe in God?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound like Pops when he was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, wake up! You're rookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys better check yourselves\Nbefore you wreck yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, nothing you've\Nthrown at us has done a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you what they call us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Drought!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wildfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And Plague!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the three calamities\Nthat protect Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're called the lead performers\Nbecause we always take center stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to describe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since I took off that stupid\Nraid suit, my body has felt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not drag me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I felt sick, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just feels kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, weird, like your eyebrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I said my body, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridal grabber!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, you shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard all of Judge's kids are cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of you is artificial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Judge is as crazy as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet he got real creative with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is that burning\Nleg of yours a machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you,\Npal, But unlike my siblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 100% human. Humans can't light\Nthemselves on fire, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know damn well\Nyou're not a Lunarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all natural my\Npassion is hotter than
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,fire so you better believe\NI can bring the heat I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cook sea monsters with this\Nleg. I'll cook a dinosaur too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you cyborg technology\Nthat even Vegapunk can't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoy the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pay attention, you big-ass mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of blade is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I don't need formal\Nstyle to cut someone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You never called yourself a\Nswordsman in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how this will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,By the end of this fight, I might be\Ntearing your throat out with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Enma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is indeed, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I had my misgivings, when Lady\NHiyori said she would give Enma to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a reason I couldn't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That sword he took, if it truly is Shusui,\Nyou should return it to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a sword that was handed\Ndown to me from my late father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be a fair trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can give\Nme a replacement, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's strange because he's a pirate from\Na foreign land, but when I look at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but see the\Nyoung Daimyo of Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimotuki Ushimaru, fighting with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, even their swordplay is similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Ushimaru descended from the\NGod of the Blade, Shimotsuki Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that Zorojuro returned Shusui\Nto the land of Wano feels like fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even a one-eyed samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Rilliuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see the moon, so your\NSue Longform won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, King of the Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgive you for lying about\Nthe samovar you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You already paid the\Nprice with your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to bring rice\Nhome, otherwise your leg is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that I don't\Nknow anyone named Rhizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's here, I'll cut my own belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You are more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have laid down our lives\Na hundred times to protect Rhizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our honor demanded it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been too ashamed\Nto return if I had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those your last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm cutting off\Nyour head this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been preparing for this battle\Never since the day Lord Odin died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll avenge our fallen\Nlord and save Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For two decades, we've asked ourselves,\Nare we still Lord Odin's samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you transform again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole in the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:13:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never defile the name\Nof Kozuki Orochi ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to reach the final\Nbattle, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If an ancient city must fall\Nfor us to win, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we must sacrifice our lives\Nto win, then we are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our victory will bring\Na new dawn to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, these enemies just keep\Npouring out of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle taking place here\Nis far beyond men like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, pal. This is our base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You get out of our way or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you boys want to stay\Nalive, I suggest you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Wanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Master Catviper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you, Gaara, leaving\Na piece of this bastard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Pedro, Luffy and his\Nallies never would have made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This raid would have failed before\Nit even had a chance to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You really lickety loved\Nthat bastard, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on my old friend, I can't\Nhelp but gaze at that beautiful full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give Yugara a show, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a drink or two and enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the sky, you slobbering Nettie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The view of tonight's full\Nmoon shall be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a fool\Nfor serving the ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but on second thought, serving\Nthat breath is even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You do nothing to laugh at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:16:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a scout girl who grew up to be a\Nsamurai, so our lord can grow as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mono will watch over him, as\Nhe will watch over us someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will not lose to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Cone Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With the strength and dedication of\Nmy ninpo, I shall defeat my enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that thing a giant dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who invited a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Kaido. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count me out. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never make a snack out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try, I will swallow you whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, be careful!\NYou sure you're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,are you momo indeed the kid what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,happened to him so kind of is it here what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I used my right right jutsu on Lord\NMomonosuke. I didn't want to do it but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he begged me so i turned him into a\N28 year old at his request your power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,can really do that are you crying oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,lord
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You you? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,look just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking back Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.22,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on why did they collapse did\Nsomething happen you guys come on get up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can use Kakarazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Krieg, that's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fate of all who dare to bask
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,in my presence before\Nstealing their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I did take down two Tobiropo, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you might as well call\Nme Sibling Hunter Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tobiropo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defy my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Join me by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why all the bad guys are\Npassing out, but it sure is handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because Big Mom is fighting\Non the same floor as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the strong are able to withstand\Nthe power of her conqueror's Haki
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, do you know\Nwhat happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything\Nyou don't know I think
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,what Momo said earlier\Nis all that matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,though Luffy is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear his voice now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And he promised me that he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Momo is Shinobu was\Nwith him, but I can't reach her either
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what they say,\Nno news is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you are not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When you finish your\Njob, hustle on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy troops are pouring into the\Nperformance floor all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure could use a hand. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The performance floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.44,0:20:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let a single one of them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji are fighting two\Nof the lead performers in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And they can't afford to\Nlose. Yeah, but that doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mean I take orders from\Nyou? Well, don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,oh fire please stop burning\Nme although it would make
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes sense to cremate me. No,\NI'm not ready for that. Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't help catch the protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Baron Corpse! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The short of it is we need to\Nget out of the castle quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do any of you minks know\Nhow the raid is progressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I've seen out there is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, on the way here, I\Nran into Jinbe on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Arribas Brickfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard any news in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your captain still battling\Nagainst Kaido on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been too busy fighting\Nto find out. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get bogged down like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find the strong\Nopponents and focus on them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jim, a help! It's me, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fire down here on the\Nthird floor and it's spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get downstairs,\Nthen you'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait... The roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's keeping Kaido busy up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Naricobra arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Madra arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up! You're never gonna become
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,odin why should i listen to the man who
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.70,0:23:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,wants me dead that was your doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't a family quarrel and it isn't a game
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,if you take the name of odin you must\Nbe prepared for war do you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I should be\Npunished for admiring someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Odin, but you can't\Ntake that away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,BALLS, I 'LL PROTECT THE\NLAND OF WADO, OUT OF MY WAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,NOW, OFTEN THE PORTERS OF WADO ARE Tang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Was she always this violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but she's been terrorizing\Nus like this all week!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:23:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be Commander Kaido's\Ndaughter, but she's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can\Ntake us all on at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in and stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.12,0:24:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.90,0:24:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, just come quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.40,0:24:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rony!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't even touch him, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:25:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one responsible\Nfor all this? Yamato? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.64,0:25:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Odin, not Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer my question, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who did this to my men?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.08,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They just collapsed on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get these chains off of me, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't feed me, I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.88,0:25:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you've decided you\Nwant to be Odin, then die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cool your\Nhead in here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A month ought to do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me in here. It's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.14,0:26:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole month, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.16,0:26:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ogre Princess is tough, but\Nthere's no way she can survive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there are samurai from the\Nland of Wano locked up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're as dangerous as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you the same\Nmercy as my idiot child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.04,0:26:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one month to get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.58,0:26:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you change your mind, shout\Nthrough the air hole in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them you want to join my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.34,0:26:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll let you out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How many days has it been\Nsince you ate something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.94,0:26:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.22,0:26:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.28,0:26:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or one of you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordsmen should not be\Nwithout their swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.16,0:26:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I know, you're my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.16,0:26:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.60,0:26:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.02,0:26:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't give them their swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.76,0:26:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, why would they want to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.28,0:27:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you were Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm Odin, I'm also the\Nson of Kaido, who killed Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be too easy for those\Nsamurai to take their revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Father only put that food there\Nso we would fight over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.52,0:27:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no point in\Nme thinking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to kill me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.70,0:27:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.04,0:27:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.26,0:27:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.96,0:28:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of I don't get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.74,0:28:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'll eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really hungry, so I'll eat the\Nwhole thing if you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.28,0:28:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.90,0:28:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.64,0:28:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's sins are not your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your domino is so tough, I can't\Nbelieve you don't get hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Samurai, I would\Nhave died without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.82,0:29:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this\Nmeal, for as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.22,0:29:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I become a Samurai,\Neven though I get hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.20,0:29:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.78,0:29:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you're Kozuki Odin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.64,0:29:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We overheard your talk, and I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.70,0:29:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We love Odin as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.24,0:29:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What name does a fallen samurai need?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.98,0:30:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call me so-and-so
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.70,0:30:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to read a journal I\Nfound, but it has too many hard words.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You had Odin's travelogue\Nall this time, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This world has four seas as well\Nas one long and narrow waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,apparently he says the planet's round\Njust like a dumpling what a mysterious
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,thing how long has it been 10
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.64,0:30:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,days i already lost count it's all
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting to blur together. Kaido is\Ntoo cruel. I can't believe he would let
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.56,0:30:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His own child die like this. At this\Nrate, I fear we may not live long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to see the battle that odin\Npredicted it'll happen and when it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.64,0:30:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,does i'll fight on the side of wano\Nand its people i'll go out to see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.98,0:31:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,like odin i'll become stronger and
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.30,0:31:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,stronger in that case i won't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.20,0:31:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our path is clear. Dead or alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.32,0:31:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there's an important\Nrole for us to play in
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that war To ensure that you won't die here
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.16,0:31:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years is a long time Too\Nlong for us to wait, I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.10,0:31:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is going to kill you for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.40,0:31:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stay here and\Nspend my final days rotting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We never intended to give in to Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.76,0:31:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave the land of Wano to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.90,0:32:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido, the prisoners\Nbroke out of the sacred cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them leave here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you, because\Nthere are people who believe in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.66,0:32:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who accept me for who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.88,0:32:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to take away the\Nfreedom of one of those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To take away my freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.86,0:32:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is more than just a series\Nof questions and answers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You ignorant brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.52,0:32:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful World!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.86,0:32:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
